WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.034
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.034 --> 00:00:03.136
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:04.504
We hope you're all
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.106
And now if you don't mind,
we are going to get to the news.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:09.175
Today was Groundhog Day,
and Punxsutawney Phil

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:12.345
says we've got about six
or seven winters left.

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.714
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.148 --> 00:00:18.150
Senate Judiciary chairman
Dick Durbin

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.552
told reporters this week

00:00:19.552 --> 00:00:22.789
that White House chief of staff
Ron Klain leaked the news

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:25.725
of Supreme Court justice
Stephen Breyer's retirement

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:28.828
and -- this is crazy --
Rihanna's pregnancy.

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:30.430
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.400
Yes, congratulations, my friend.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.102
House majority whip Jim Clyburn
said in a new interview

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:38.204
that President Biden's

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:39.873
yet-to-be-named
Supreme Court nominee

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.842
should be someone who did not
go to an Ivy League school,

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:45.912
as opposed to someone who went
but doesn't remember it.

00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:47.680
[ Applause ]

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:50.516
Republican senator John Kennedy
told reporters recently

00:00:50.516 --> 00:00:53.186
that he had concerns about
President Biden's criteria

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.621
for a Supreme Court nominee

00:00:54.621 --> 00:00:57.790
and said, "I want a nominee
who knows a law book

00:00:57.790 --> 00:00:59.259
from a J. Crew catalog."

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:03.496
I'm sorry, do you think that's
where black women famously shop?

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:04.964
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:09.268
'Cause if so, I don't think
you know a J. Crew catalog.

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:10.670
That catalog is so white,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.573
it's what they used to swear in
Amy Coney Barrett.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.907
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:19.011
Tesla has issued a recall
for more than 50,000 vehicles

00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:21.647
to disable a feature
which prevents them

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.451
from rolling through stop signs
without coming to a full halt,

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:27.687
or as Tesla calls it,
Mercedes mode.

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.989
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.890
The Washington Football Team
announced today

00:01:31.890 --> 00:01:33.426
that it officially
changed its name

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:37.330
to the Washington Commanders,
as in "Rams 37, Commanders 3."

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.231
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.231 --> 00:01:42.534
And finally, today was singer
Shakira's 45th birthday.

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:43.969
Her hips still don't lie,

00:01:43.969 --> 00:01:47.707
but they have started repeating
the same stories.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.275
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

